 "By gender": "按性別",
 "Joined": "加入",
 "Baptised": "受洗",
 "How far the follow-up has come. Records → Reports → New visitors counts each step.": "跟進進度。記錄 → 報表 → 新朋友 會統計每一步。",
 "switch on {m} first": "請先開啟{m}",
 "Attendance, new visitors (names and follow-up; contact details only with the personal-data switch below) and notes for the team, and the attendance report. With Read & write, agents may record attendance, notes and visitors — never money.": "出席、新朋友（姓名和跟進；聯絡資料須開啟下方的個人資料開關）和給同工的備註，以及出席報表。設為讀寫時，AI 可記錄出席、備註和新朋友——永遠不能更改金額。",
 "Offerings and cash counts, and the offerings report. Part of Service records: needs it switched on. Always read only: agents never change money, sign or verify a count. Read-only accounts never see offerings.": "奉獻和現金點算，以及奉獻報表。屬於聚會記錄：須先開啟聚會記錄。永遠只讀：AI 不會更改金額、簽名或確認點算。只讀帳戶永遠看不到奉獻。",
