 "This record is in the {year} archive, so it is read-only and not counted in reports. Administrators can open the archive, or bring the record back to correct it, under Settings → Security & privacy.": "這份記錄在 {year} 年的歸檔中，所以是隻讀的，也不計入報表。管理員可以在 設置 → 安全與隱私 中打開歸檔，或取回這份記錄以便更正。",
 "Open the archive": "打開歸檔",
