 "The change log keeps {m} months, so its entries are removed before they are old enough to archive: archives will hold service records, not their history. To archive the history too, keep the change log longer (Settings → Change log).": "修改記錄只保留 {m} 個月，日誌在夠舊可以歸檔之前就會被刪除：歸檔只會有聚會記錄，沒有修改歷史。若要連歷史一起歸檔，請把修改記錄保留久一點（設置 → 修改記錄）。",
 "Archived by Canon 0.11.0: download the archive and compare the records before bringing one back.": "這是 Canon 0.11.0 歸檔的：取回之前，請先下載歸檔並比較這些記錄。",
 "{n} services with two records": "{n} 次聚會有兩份記錄",
 "Bring this record back into Canon to correct it? It leaves the archive until the next archiving, and the change is logged.": "把這份記錄取回 Canon 以便更正？在下次歸檔之前，它會離開歸檔；這項操作會記錄在修改記錄中。",
 "Brought back: it can be corrected on Service records.": "已取回：可以在聚會記錄中更正。",
