 "Each week, type the announcements in the service’s Bulletin tab, then print from Outputs → Bulletin.": "每週在聚會的「次序單」分頁輸入報告事項，然後從「輸出 → 次序單」打印。",
 "Starts from the full-words booklet": "以「全文小冊子」為起點",
 "Cover as chosen for the service": "封面依聚會的設定",
 "Table": "表格",
 "{n} sections": "{n} 個部分",
 "All bulletin templates": "所有次序單模板",
 "Built-in templates come with Canon and can’t be changed. Make a copy to change what prints or the page layout.": "自帶模板不能修改。複製一份後，就可以改印出的內容或版面。",
 "Paper and languages": "紙張與語言",
 "Cover and order of service": "封面與聚會程序",
 "A short note shown in the template list, e.g. “Lord’s Supper Sundays”.": "顯示在模板列表中的簡短說明，例如「聖餐主日」。",
 "A4 landscape, folded, makes an A5 booklet: print double-sided, flip on the short edge, then fold.": "A4 橫向對摺成 A5 小冊子：雙面打印、短邊翻頁，然後對摺。",
 "Automatic picks a size that suits the paper. Choose a smaller size if pages overflow.": "「自動」會按紙張選字號；若內容超出一頁，請選小一點的字號。",
 "Side by side keeps each line next to its translation; one after the other suits narrow paper.": "「並排」讓每行與譯文對照；「先後排列」適合較窄的紙張。",
 "“As chosen for the service” follows the cover picked in each service, else the church default in Settings → Church.": "「依聚會的設定」會用每堂聚會選的封面，否則用「設置 → 教會」中的默認封面。",
 "Order of service layout": "聚會程序版式",
 "How this works": "使用說明",
 "You have unsaved changes. The preview already shows them.": "有尚未保存的修改，預覽已顯示修改後的樣子。",
