 "New service starts from this template.": "新建聚會時會以這個模板開始。",
 "Export to a file": "導出為文件",
 "Save this template as one file, to use on another computer or share with another church.": "把這個模板存成一個文件，可在另一臺電腦使用，或與其他教會分享。",
 "Template imported.": "模板已導入。",
 "Add a template from a file exported by Canon, on this or another computer.": "從 Canon 導出的模板文件（本機或其他電腦）加入模板。",
 "Import a template file…": "導入模板文件…",
 "Added to Library → QR codes & notes": "已加入「資料庫 → 二維碼與短句」",
 "Slide backgrounds": "投影背景",
 "fits 4:3 screens; small for widescreen": "適合 4:3 屏幕；寬屏會偏小",
 "smaller than the screen: it may look blurry": "比屏幕小：可能會模糊",
