 "Hymnal numbers": "詩本編號",
 "Add number": "添加編號",
 "Add your hymnals in Library → Hymnals to record hymn numbers.": "請先在「資料庫 → 詩本」添加詩本，才能記錄詩歌編號。",
 "Printed hymnbooks your church sings from. A song can have a number in several hymnals.": "教會聚會所用的印刷詩本。同一首詩歌可在多本詩本中有不同編號。",
