 "Number or title": "編號或標題",
 "No songs in this hymnal yet": "此詩本尚無詩歌",
 "Add numbers in a song, or import the hymnal index from a CSV file.": "可在詩歌中添加編號，或從 CSV 文件導入詩本目錄。",
 "Delete this hymnal? Songs stay in the library; only their numbers in this hymnal are removed.": "刪除此詩本？詩歌仍保留在資料庫中，只會移除它們在此詩本中的編號。",
