 "New songs are tagged needs-words: add the words you are licensed to use in each song.": "新詩歌已標記 needs-words：請在各詩歌中加入教會獲授權使用的歌詞。",
 "One row per hymn: the number and its title in one or more languages. Existing songs are matched by title; the others are added with their title only. Hymn words are not imported.": "每行一首詩歌：編號及一種或多種語言的標題。標題相同的現有詩歌會自動連結，其餘只以標題新增。不會導入歌詞。",
