 "rows": "行",
 "Imported": "已導入",
 "Westminster Standards": "威斯敏斯德信仰準則",
 "the Shorter Catechism (107 questions), Larger Catechism (196) and Confession of Faith (33 chapters), public domain, English. Use any questions or sections in a service.": "小要理問答（107問）、大要理問答（196問）及信條（33章），公共領域，英文。聚會中可選用任何問答或條文。",
 "Import Westminster Standards": "導入威斯敏斯德信仰準則",
 "parts": "部分",
 "Introduction (optional)": "引言（可選）",
 "Use numbered parts": "分為編號部分",
 "For catechisms and confessions: each question or section is a part that services can pick.": "適用於要理問答與信條：每一問或每一條為一部分，聚會程序可自行選用。",
 "Parts": "部分",
 "Number or words": "編號或文字",
 "Add part": "添加部分",
 "Each part is one question: \"L: question\" on the first line, \"C: answer\" on the next, so the minister asks and the congregation answers.": "每部分為一問：第一行「L: 問題」，下一行「C: 答案」，由牧者發問、會眾回答。",
 "Each part is one section; a part title (e.g. the chapter) is printed when it changes.": "每部分為一條；部分標題（如章名）在變更時印出。",
 "Part title (optional)": "部分標題（可選）",
 "Which hymnal number is printed and projected": "次序單與投影顯示哪一本詩本的編號",
 "This song has no words yet (it came from a hymnal index). Add the words you are licensed to use in the Library, or the bulletin shows the number and title only.": "此詩歌尚無歌詞（來自詩本目錄）。請在資料庫加入獲授權的歌詞，否則次序單隻顯示編號與標題。",
 "The full Westminster Shorter Catechism (all 107 questions) is in the library: use it to pick any questions.": "資料庫已有完整的威斯敏斯德小要理問答（107問），可從中選用任何問答。",
 "Import the Westminster Standards in Library → Liturgical texts to use any of the 107 questions.": "請在「資料庫 → 禮文」導入威斯敏斯德信仰準則，即可選用全部107問。",
