 "Next": "下一組",
 "Not found": "找不到",
 "Choose from the list": "從列表中選擇",
 "No text in this language yet — add it in the Library.": "此語言尚無內容——請在資料庫添加。",
 "Uploaded Bibles are only shown inside your church’s Canon and its bulletins and slides. Some publishers (e.g. ESV, NIV) limit how many verses may be printed or projected; your church is responsible for following the licence.": "上傳的聖經譯本只在本教會的 Canon 及其次序單和投影片中顯示。部分出版社（如 ESV、NIV）限制可印刷或投影的經文節數；教會須自行遵守授權條款。",
 "Code: 2–12 capital letters, digits or hyphens (e.g. ESV, CUNP, TB2).": "代號：2–12 個大寫字母、數字或連字符（例如 ESV、CUNP、TB2）。",
 "This code belongs to a public-domain Bible in another language; choose another code.": "此代號屬於另一種語言的公版聖經，請換一個代號。",
 "Replace {code} ({name}, {n} verses) with this file?": "用此文件替換 {code}（{name}，{n} 節）？",
 "Import readable verses and skip problem rows": "導入可讀取的經文並跳過有問題的行",
 "Tick the permission box first": "請先勾選授權確認",
 "Replace {code}": "替換 {code}",
 "Import {n} verses": "導入 {n} 節經文",
 "Add a Bible": "添加聖經譯本",
 "How to add a Bible": "如何添加聖經譯本",
 "Use a translation your church has permission to use: ask the publisher or Bible society (e.g. Crossway for ESV, the Hong Kong Bible Society for 和合本修订版, the Indonesian Bible Society for Alkitab) for a licensed text file.": "請使用本教會已獲授權的譯本：向出版社或聖經公會（如 ESV 的 Crossway、和合本修訂版的香港聖經公會、Alkitab 的印尼聖經公會）索取授權的經文文件。",
 "Put it in a spreadsheet with one verse per row and the columns book, chapter, verse, text. Book can be a number 1–66, an English name or abbreviation (Gen, 1 Cor) or a Chinese name (创世记, 林前).": "在電子表格中每行一節經文，欄位為 book（書卷）、chapter（章）、verse（節）、text（經文）。書卷可填 1–66 的編號、英文書名或縮寫（Gen、1 Cor），或中文書名（創世記、林前）。",
 "Save it from Excel as \"CSV UTF-8 (Comma delimited)\". A scrollmapper JSON file also works.": "在 Excel 中另存為「CSV UTF-8（逗號分隔）」。scrollmapper 的 JSON 文件也可以。",
 "Nothing is saved until you have checked the preview and pressed Import.": "在您檢查預覽並按「導入」之前，不會保存任何資料。",
